    "image_count": 5,
    "status": "souvenir",
    "salutation": "(none — souvenir folder without handwritten message)",
    "body": "[[Address: Miss Joan Northcutt / Stanford, Ky. / Route 9 (or 4)]]\nPostmark: El Paso, Tex. — Jul 11, 7:30 PM, 1940\nSent at 1½¢ \"postage without message\" rate\n\nPrinted material only — the souvenir folder contains color-printed views of El Paso landmarks (Mills Street, San Jacinto Plaza, Hotel Paso del Norte, Bassett Tower, Mount Franklin, the Rio Grande Bridge, etc.) and a printed boilerplate description of El Paso on the back cover.\n\nNo salutation, no body, no signature — only Gene's hand on the address.",
